# renv is intentionally not activated.
#
# renv.lock pins R 4.2.0 and 230 packages from 2022. Most of those versions are
# no longer installable, so activating renv here makes the project unbuildable
# rather than reproducible. The lockfile is kept as a record of what the 2022
# renders used; see renv.lock.
#
# The exercises now render against current CRAN packages, and the results are
# committed under _freeze/ so a normal site build re-executes no R at all.
# To re-execute an exercise yourself, just render it with a current R.
